    "title": "Park Forest Police Blotter Reports Beginning September 26, 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gary Kopycinski ,\n6 hours ago Park Forest, IL—(ENEWSPF)— According to police, an officer noticed a car that was driving after 2 a.m. at 20 to 25 mph on Sauk Trail. The car reportedly had no headlights on. In a separate incident, police charged a woman with DUI and a charge related to a child asleep in the back of her vehicle with no proper child restraint. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
